    "name": "Shivaji Park Detention Backlash Protest",
    "location": "Shivaji Park, Dadar West, Mumbai",
    "cause": "Protesting the mass detention of approximately 300 citizens and activists during the July 20 Cockroach Janta Party voter roll demonstrations, and demanding systemic accountability for police overreach.",
