    "location": "Hazratganj intersection, Lucknow",
    "cause": "Samajwadi Party workers are protesting at Hazratganj intersection demanding the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar over alleged electoral malpractice and bias. The protest is part of a broader opposition campaign against the Election Commission's conduct.",
    "dangerLevel": "high",
