    "location": "National Conference Party Headquarters, Srinagar (and district offices across J&K)",
    "cause": "Marking seven years since the abrogation of Article 370 on August 5, 2019, the ruling National Conference staged protests demanding restoration of J&K's special status and statehood, terming August 5 as 'Black Day'.",
