    "cause": "Protesters are marking the seventh anniversary of the abrogation of Article 370 and Article 35-A, demanding restoration of Jammu and Kashmir's special constitutional status. Organizers stated they want to send a message to New Delhi that the people of J&K are peace-loving but that Article 370 and 35-A 'live in their hearts.'",
