    "location": "Leh Main Market to Polo Ground, Leh",
    "cause": "Protestors demand the release of the official inquiry report into the 2025 violence in Ladakh, which left multiple people injured and led to mass arrests. They also seek accountability for alleged police brutality during the crackdown.",
