    "cause": "The march, backed by the Shiromani Gurdwara Parbandhak Committee (SGPC) and Qaumi Insaaf Morcha, demands the release of Sikh prisoners held in jails across Punjab, Haryana, and Chandigarh. The protest has gained urgency after a jailed extremist's video surfaced on August 20, 2026, calling for a mass mobilization.",
